# Generated riscv-formal task dirs — regenerate with `make checks` in this
# directory.  genchecks.py owns checks/ (it rmtrees and rewrites it), so
# nothing inside is committed.  The sv2v flat is built here, OUTSIDE checks/
# (a flat inside it was deleted by genchecks before sby ran), and is not
# committed either: `make checks` rebuilds it every run.
/checks/
/*_flat.v
/.flat_build/
